<title>NEW ZEALAND: BNZ cuts NZ variable mortgage rate to 9.4 pct.</title>
<headline>BNZ cuts NZ variable mortgage rate to 9.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of New Zealand said on Wednesday it would cut its New Zealand variable home lending rate to 9.4 percent from 9.95 percent, effective on June 3.</p>
<p>The cut brings BNZ into line with other banks which have already announced similar cuts.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
